                        "extension": "rs",
                        "language_id": "rust",
                        "label": "Rust"
                    }
                ],
                "environment_note": "cargo cannot resolve this workspace's dependencies offline: the crate registry cache is not reachable from the sandbox. Errors below may be about crates cargo could not read. Name a host directory for the Cargo home under Settings -> Extensions -> rust-analyzer (Edit, Dependencies) and fill it there: run \"cargo fetch\" into it, or add it to the project's Sandbox Configuration mounts with CARGO_HOME set to its container path so a task can download into it.",
